    "Native Song of the Dryads casting is rejected during combat without flash, then permitted with supplied Vedalken Orrery; three mana are paid.",
    "Disenchant pays two mana; positive restoration returns the old defender type but leaves all three defense/loyalty counters intact after damage.",
    "Counterspell pays two mana and targets pending Disenchant; both spells reach the graveyard and Song remains attached.",
    "Both defender types and both trample forms cover original and post-resolution copied worlds. Over-planeswalkers also covers countered restoration.",
